meta {
  name: 1. Create User
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/auth/users
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "email": "{{email}}",
    "name": "Bruno",
    "surname": "Tester",
    "password": "{{password}}"
  }
}

docs {
  Registers a user and sends a verification e-mail (the answer is always 204, also when the e-mail is
  already registered - no account enumeration). The account cannot log in until the e-mail is
  confirmed: open Mailpit (http://localhost:8025), copy the token from the link in the message and
  put it into the {{verifyToken}} variable, then run Account/1. Verify E-mail.
}
